Subject: [PATCH] Release notes: libraries also containing the functions of the
 generic interface

The release notes of version 5.2 describe the generic-parallel interfaces
built on their generic interface, the generic_functions option (interface
Generic exported, functions of batches detected by their version, one
set of parameters and, for a behaviour, one out of bounds policy), and
the precise floating point model requested by the configuration files of
icpx.
